# Template. Copy to ~/.config/gh-workflows/secrets.env, fill in the values, chmod 600.
# NEVER commit the filled-in copy — this repo is public. `onboard.sh` reads the copy
# under ~/.config (override with GH_WORKFLOWS_SECRETS=/some/other/path) and pushes each
# value into the target repo's Actions secrets. Values never print to the terminal.
#
# GitHub secrets are write-only: once stored, nobody — not even you — can read a value
# back (`gh api repos/X/actions/secrets/NAME` returns only the name and timestamps), and
# personal accounts have no account-level Actions secrets to share one copy from. So this
# file is the ONLY master copy. A value you type straight into the GitHub web UI must also
# be added here, or the next repo you onboard has nowhere to get it from.

# Lets Claude run inside the iterate workflow and edit code. Generate with
# `claude setup-token` (starts with sk-ant-oat01-). Long-lived — one from March was
# still valid in July. Missing => Codex reviews land but nobody acts on them.
CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN=

# Lets the iterate workflow post the literal comment "@codex review" to summon a
# re-review. Must be a fine-grained PAT owned by your real account: comments made with
# the Actions-provided GITHUB_TOKEN are authored by github-actions[bot], and Codex
# ignores bots. Create at https://github.com/settings/personal-access-tokens with
# Repository access "All repositories" + Metadata read + Issues and Pull requests
# read & write — that scope covers new repos with no edit needed.
# Regenerating invalidates the old value immediately, so re-run onboard.sh (or reset the
# secret) on EVERY repo afterwards. A repo left holding the stale value still shows green
# CI; only the Codex re-review step stops, silently.
CODEX_TRIGGER_TOKEN=

# Pushover credentials for phone alerts when the pipeline breaks (token missing/expired,
# Codex never answers three summons, re-review times out). From your Pushover app +
# account page. Missing => the pipeline still runs, failures just go unnoticed.
PUSHOVER_TOKEN=
PUSHOVER_USER=
